---
import FieldworkLayout from '../../layouts/FieldworkLayout.astro';
---

<FieldworkLayout
  title="Parks and open space | Fieldwork"
  description="Fieldwork designs parks and open spaces with the communities who use them, from pocket parks to regional landscapes."
>
  <main id="main">
    <!-- Template: Service detail. Page header (split) / Split content / Feature grid / Related carousel / FAQ / CTA -->

    <header class="page-header" data-layout="split">
      <div class="page-header__inner container">
        <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <ol>
            <li><a href="/templates/home/">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="/templates/services/">Services</a></li>
            <li><a href="/templates/service/" aria-current="page">Parks and open space</a></li>
          </ol>
        </nav>
        <p class="page-header__label">Service 01</p>
        <h1 class="page-header__title text-page-title">Parks and open space</h1>
        <p class="page-header__lead text-lead">From pocket parks to regional landscapes, designed with the communities who will use and look after them.</p>
        <div class="page-header__actions button-group" data-stack="mobile">
          <a class="button" href="/templates/contact/">Discuss a park project</a>
          <a class="button" data-variant="secondary" href="#projects">See parks we have designed</a>
        </div>
        <figure class="page-header__media media" data-ratio="portrait">
          <img src="https://placehold.co/1600x1200/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="Meadow planting beside a new footpath" width="1600" height="1200" fetchpriority="high">
        </figure>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="section" data-spacing="none" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="split" data-sticky>
          <div class="split__aside">
            <header class="section-header">
              <p class="section-header__label">Approach</p>
              <h2 class="section-header__title text-section-heading" id="approach-title">Parks are the most democratic places a city has.</h2>
            </header>
          </div>
          <div class="split__main prose">
            <p class="text-lead">We design them to be free, open and welcoming to everyone, and robust enough to stay that way for fifty years.</p>
            <p>Every park project starts with a season of listening: walking the site at different times of day, talking to people who use it and people who avoid it, and mapping what already works. The brief that comes out of that process is shared with the client and the community before we draw anything.</p>
            <h3>What we deliver</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Feasibility studies and funding bids, including National Lottery Heritage Fund applications</li>
              <li>Concept to technical design, planning and construction packages</li>
              <li>Planting design, with maintenance plans written for the teams who will carry them out</li>
              <li>Play strategies and play space design for all ages and abilities</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Most park projects run for two to four years from brief to opening. We stay involved for five years after that.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="focus-title">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="section-header">
          <p class="section-header__label">Focus areas</p>
          <h2 class="section-header__title text-section-heading" id="focus-title">Where we spend most of our time.</h2>
        </header>
        <div class="grid" data-columns="3">
          <div class="feature" data-size="large">
            <svg class="feature__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="6"/><path d="M12 15v7M8 22h8"/></svg>
            <h3 class="feature__title">Climate resilience</h3>
            <p class="feature__text">Shade, drainage and planting that keeps parks usable through heatwaves and storms.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature" data-size="large">
            <svg class="feature__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="7" r="3"/><circle cx="16" cy="7" r="3"/><path d="M2 21c0-4 3-7 6-7s6 3 6 7M12 21c0-4 1-7 4-7s6 3 6 7"/></svg>
            <h3 class="feature__title">Play for all ages</h3>
            <p class="feature__text">Inclusive play that works for toddlers, teenagers, carers and grandparents.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature" data-size="large">
            <svg class="feature__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 20c4-10 14-10 18 0M12 4v8M8 8l4 4 4-4"/></svg>
            <h3 class="feature__title">Heritage landscapes</h3>
            <p class="feature__text">Restoring historic parks with the evidence and sensitivity they deserve.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="projects" data-surface="alternate" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="section-header">
          <p class="section-header__label">Projects</p>
          <h2 class="section-header__title text-section-heading" id="projects-title">Parks we have designed.</h2>
          <div class="section-header__action"><a class="link" href="/templates/case-studies/">All projects</a></div>
        </header>
        <section class="carousel" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
          <div class="carousel__controls">
            <p class="carousel__status" aria-live="polite"></p>
            <button class="button" type="button" data-variant="secondary" data-size="small" data-icon-only data-carousel="prev" aria-label="Previous projects"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 8H3M7 4L3 8l4 4"/></svg></button>
            <button class="button" type="button" data-variant="secondary" data-size="small" data-icon-only data-carousel="next" aria-label="Next projects"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg></button>
          </div>
          <ul class="carousel__track" tabindex="0" aria-label="Park projects, scrollable">
            <li class="carousel__slide"><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="standard"><img src="https://placehold.co/1600x1200/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy"></figure><p class="card__meta"><span>Halden</span><span>2025</span></p><h3 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/case-study/">Millbrook Riverside Park</a></h3></article></li>
            <li class="carousel__slide"><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="standard"><img src="https://placehold.co/1600x1200/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy"></figure><p class="card__meta"><span>Bristol</span><span>2023</span></p><h3 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/case-study/">St Agnes Park restoration</a></h3></article></li>
            <li class="carousel__slide"><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="standard"><img src="https://placehold.co/1600x1200/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy"></figure><p class="card__meta"><span>Glasgow</span><span>2022</span></p><h3 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/case-study/">Kelvin Meadows</a></h3></article></li>
            <li class="carousel__slide"><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="standard"><img src="https://placehold.co/1600x1200/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy"></figure><p class="card__meta"><span>Northgate</span><span>2021</span></p><h3 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/case-study/">Northgate Commons</a></h3></article></li>
            <li class="carousel__slide"><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="standard"><img src="https://placehold.co/1600x1200/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy"></figure><p class="card__meta"><span>Bath</span><span>2020</span></p><h3 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/case-study/">Sydney Gardens play</a></h3></article></li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="split">
          <div class="split__aside">
            <header class="section-header">
              <p class="section-header__label">FAQ</p>
              <h2 class="section-header__title text-section-heading" id="faq-title">Common questions about park projects.</h2>
            </header>
          </div>
          <div class="split__main">
            <div class="accordion">
              <details class="accordion__item" name="service-faq">
                <summary class="accordion__trigger">How much does a park project cost?<span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
                <div class="accordion__panel"><p>Fees are usually 8 to 12% of construction cost. We will give you a fixed fee for each stage before work starts.</p></div>
              </details>
              <details class="accordion__item" name="service-faq">
                <summary class="accordion__trigger">Can you help with funding applications?<span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
                <div class="accordion__panel"><p>Yes. We have supported bids totalling £41m, including eight successful Heritage Fund applications.</p></div>
              </details>
              <details class="accordion__item" name="service-faq">
                <summary class="accordion__trigger">Do you work outside the UK?<span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
                <div class="accordion__panel"><p>Occasionally, with a local partner practice. Most of our work is in England and Scotland.</p></div>
              </details>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" data-surface="brand" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta" data-layout="inline">
          <div class="cta__content">
            <h2 class="text-page-title" id="cta-title">Planning a park?</h2>
            <p class="cta__text">A partner will reply within two working days.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cta__actions">
            <a class="button" href="/templates/contact/">Start a conversation <svg class="icon" data-icon="arrow-right" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</FieldworkLayout>
